    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Trail is an abstracted dungeon crawler where you send adventures on a quest, making use of dice manipulation to overcome challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You love gambling, don't you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.poster.avif?t=1748977245\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.webm?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.mp4?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The archfiend known as the Lord of Greed awoke from his slumber to spread chaos the world. As the Guildmaster, you are tasked with hiring adventurers and guiding them on a quest to stop him. But how are newbie mercenaries from a small town guild meant to defy such odds?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Money. The answer is &quot;money&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.poster.avif?t=1748977245\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.webm?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.mp4?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Dungeon Trail, Fate is an entity that loves gold and will accept bribes in exchange for second chances. Whether an attack would fail to hit, a trap would hurt too much or an enemy blow would result in certain death, a little gold coin can be offered to change one's immediate destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sword, sorcery and rolling bones<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.poster.avif?t=1748977245\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.webm?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.mp4?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where's the fun of gambling without a little cheating? Dice manipulation isn't only allowed, it's encouraged with Tricks, which are consumables that allow you to determine specific results easily. We can't let leave everything up to Fate...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reroll, regroup, restart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure where managing resources (be them gold, health or human lives) is everything and the difference between perishing or profiting is decided by dice throws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party can be substituted easily should any of them perish. If the difficulty feels overwhelming, a Prestige mechanic allows you to go back with more resources and start over stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A new challenge every run:</i> Events are randomized every time you play for maximum dungeon crawling goodness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Change destiny</i>: use gold to reroll your way out of dangerous situations or into good fortune, or Tricks to change specific dice to predetermined results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>15 Character Classes</i>, leading to over 1365 possible final party configurations! Will you prioritize battles, safety or gold farming?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>80+ enemies</i> to battle, with abilities that will require attention and a lot of luck to get through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy to pick up, hard to put down:</i> Gameplay designed to be played in short bursts, with autosave on every Town and a Prestige feature to give players a smoother restart if they fall on hard times late in a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No microtransactions</i>: dive deep into the fun part of gambling without any real world consequences.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Trail is an abstracted dungeon crawler where you send adventures on a quest, making use of dice manipulation to overcome challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You love gambling, don't you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.poster.avif?t=1748977245\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.webm?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/6a3cfbed02608d341cbe15bf40b0202e.mp4?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The archfiend known as the Lord of Greed awoke from his slumber to spread chaos the world. As the Guildmaster, you are tasked with hiring adventurers and guiding them on a quest to stop him. But how are newbie mercenaries from a small town guild meant to defy such odds?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Money. The answer is &quot;money&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.poster.avif?t=1748977245\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.webm?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/5f5cb0d43a21d6bb6f5dc14dcb519841.mp4?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Dungeon Trail, Fate is an entity that loves gold and will accept bribes in exchange for second chances. Whether an attack would fail to hit, a trap would hurt too much or an enemy blow would result in certain death, a little gold coin can be offered to change one's immediate destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sword, sorcery and rolling bones<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.poster.avif?t=1748977245\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.webm?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741600/extras/1d7d95848da2e631d945b8656d187838.mp4?t=1748977245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where's the fun of gambling without a little cheating? Dice manipulation isn't only allowed, it's encouraged with Tricks, which are consumables that allow you to determine specific results easily. We can't let leave everything up to Fate...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reroll, regroup, restart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure where managing resources (be them gold, health or human lives) is everything and the difference between perishing or profiting is decided by dice throws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party can be substituted easily should any of them perish. If the difficulty feels overwhelming, a Prestige mechanic allows you to go back with more resources and start over stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A new challenge every run:</i> Events are randomized every time you play for maximum dungeon crawling goodness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Change destiny</i>: use gold to reroll your way out of dangerous situations or into good fortune, or Tricks to change specific dice to predetermined results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>15 Character Classes</i>, leading to over 1365 possible final party configurations! Will you prioritize battles, safety or gold farming?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>80+ enemies</i> to battle, with abilities that will require attention and a lot of luck to get through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy to pick up, hard to put down:</i> Gameplay designed to be played in short bursts, with autosave on every Town and a Prestige feature to give players a smoother restart if they fall on hard times late in a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No microtransactions</i>: dive deep into the fun part of gambling without any real world consequences.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A role playing game where you gamble with human lives. Roll dice, change fate.",
